manhunter-uplink-contractor-baton-name = Contractor Baton
manhunter-uplink-contractor-baton-desc = The signature weapon of the syndicate manhunter. Applies light electrical shocks to targets. These shocks are capable of affecting the inner circuitry of most robots as well, applying a short stun.

manhunter-uplink-chameleon-armor-name = Chameleon Armored Vest
manhunter-uplink-chameleon-armor-desc = A chameleon vest that offers some protection against most forms of security brutality. Be aware the protection is detectable under close examination.